</div>', NULL, 675000, 750000, 999, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0.0, 0, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-02 19:10:06', '2026-08-12 15:48:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 10, 'BDL_MO4PK', 5, 1000, '<ul>
